We will install Istio's Gateway and VirtualService resources for ingress routing
There are the istio networking resources , not the kubernetes Ingress resources  you created earlier

Helm charts we'll install: 
-------------------------

helm chart                  Purpose

base                  Installs istio's custom resource definatinos and 
                      cluster level resources
istiod                Installs the istio control plane
gateway               Instals the istio ingress gateway


We'll install the components in this order:
Base → Istiod → Ingress Gateway


We'll keep your existing NGINX Ingress running until the Istio gateway is tested successfully. Then we'll remove the NGINX Ingress resources and disable the Minikube addon.

This avoids disrupting your currently working Ecommerce UI.


