Step 4: Install the Istiod(Istio control Plane)
--------------------------------------------------

Now we'll install the istiod , the control plane of the istio service mesh , using the helm 

Istiod manages the configuration of the Envoy sidecar proxies running alongside your microservices

Its main reponsibilities include

1.Service discovery : idnetifies services running in kubernetes
2.Traffic Management : Distribute routing configuration to envoy proxies
3.Security:  manages certificate and support mutual TLS
4.Configuration management: Applies istio traffic and security policies



